     <P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 28pt"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri">6<FONT face=宋体>月</FONT><FONT face=Calibri>18</FONT><FONT face=宋体>日</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri"><FONT face=宋体>下午</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri"><FONT face=宋体>，</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri"><FONT face=宋体>我校各党支部在各自的支部活动室组织开展了以</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri">“党旗在我心中”为主题的党日活动</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri"><FONT face=宋体>，学校领导班子成员均以支部党员身份下沉各支部参加活动。活动由各</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri"><FONT face=宋体>支部书记主持。</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri"><?xml:namespace prefix = "o" ns = "urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office" /><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 28pt"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri"><FONT face=Calibri></FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: Calibri; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体"><o:p><A href="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/202006/2020062314032465.jpg" target=_blank><IMG onload=resizepic(this) onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" border=0 src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/202006/2020062314032465.jpg" width=4608 height=3456> </A></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="TEXT-ALIGN: center; MARGIN: 0pt" align=center><B><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri"><FONT face=宋体><A href="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/202006/2020062314034028.jpg" target=_blank><IMG onload=resizepic(this) onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" border=0 src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/202006/2020062314034028.jpg" width=4032 height=3024> </A></FONT></SPAN></B></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="TEXT-ALIGN: center; MARGIN: 0pt" align=center><B><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri"><FONT face=宋体><A href="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/202006/2020062314035407.jpg" target=_blank><IMG onload=resizepic(this) onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" border=0 src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/202006/2020062314035407.jpg" width=4032 height=3024> </A></FONT></SPAN></B></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="TEXT-ALIGN: center; MARGIN: 0pt" align=center><B><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri"><FONT face=宋体><A href="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/202006/2020062314040627.jpg" target=_blank><IMG onload=resizepic(this) onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" border=0 src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/202006/2020062314040627.jpg" width=3648 height=2736> </A></FONT></SPAN></B></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="TEXT-ALIGN: center; MARGIN: 0pt" align=center><B><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri"><FONT face=宋体>专题学习：学</FONT></SPAN></B><B><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri">2020<FONT face=宋体>年</FONT></SPAN></B><B><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri"><FONT face=宋体>全国两会精神</FONT></SPAN></B><B><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri"><FONT face=宋体>、学习近平总书记</FONT></SPAN></B><B><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri"><FONT face=宋体>讲话精神</FONT></SPAN></B><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 28pt"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri"><FONT face=宋体>支部活动上，围绕刚刚结束的全国两会，各支部学习了解了今年的两会新特点：人民的殿堂</FONT>——彰显人民意志，这是一次生动践行“人民至上”的特殊大会；人民的意愿——满足人民期待，这是一次格外注重“人民福祉”的非凡大会；人民的力量——实现人民梦想，这是一次空前凝聚“人民伟力”的奋进大会。各支部还各有侧重地对两会通过的《民法典》、“港版国安法”等交流了体会认识。</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 28pt"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri"></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: Calibri; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体"><o:p><A href="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/202006/2020062314042031.png" target=_blank><IMG onload=resizepic(this) onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" border=0 src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/202006/2020062314042031.png" width=826 height=489> </A></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 28pt"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri"><FONT face=宋体>随后，各支部还通过领读、重点选读等形式</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-WEIGHT: normal; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri"><FONT face=宋体>学习了《习近平在决战决胜脱贫攻坚座谈会上的讲话》，并强调在决战决胜的关键之年全体党员教师都要立足岗位，坚决贯彻总书记的讲话精神。</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-WEIGHT: normal; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="TEXT-ALIGN: center; MARGIN: 0pt" align=center><B><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri"><FONT face=宋体>党课展示</FONT></SPAN></B><B><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri"><FONT face=宋体>：支部书记讲党课、市直微党课比赛优秀作品展播</FONT></SPAN></B><B><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></B></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 28pt"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri"><FONT face=宋体>今年两会，习近平总书记强调的</FONT>“人民至上”四个字刷屏网络。</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri"><FONT face=宋体>在</FONT>“支部书记讲党课”环节，各位支部书记从总书记十大考察瞬间直观感受“人民至上”的理念精神，再从目标宗旨观、历史动力观、人民利益至上观、保障改善民生观、人民当家作主观、群众路线思想、文化使命观、造福世界人民思想等八个角度解读了“人民至上”的理论含义。通过党课学习，全体党员加深了对习近平总书记“以人民为中心的发展思想”的理解。</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 28pt"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri"></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: Calibri; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体"><o:p><A href="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/202006/2020062314043275.jpg" target=_blank><IMG onload=resizepic(this) onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" border=0 src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/202006/2020062314043275.jpg" width=4032 height=3024> </A></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 28pt"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri"><FONT face=宋体><A href="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/202006/2020062314044896.jpg" target=_blank><IMG onload=resizepic(this) onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" border=0 src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/202006/2020062314044896.jpg" width=4608 height=3456> </A></FONT></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 28pt"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri"><FONT face=宋体><A href="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/202006/2020062314050637.jpg" target=_blank><IMG onload=resizepic(this) onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" border=0 src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/202006/2020062314050637.jpg" width=4032 height=3024> </A></FONT></SPAN></P>
